# A self-assessment run (`report`/`doctor` invoked against this repo itself
# without -o) can spill its output at repo root instead of shipshape-out/
# (see README.md's documented `shipshape-out/<run-id>/` convention). Anchored
# to root so it doesn't shadow legitimate subdirectory resources/ folders
# (e.g. per-assessor resource dirs).
/report.md
/resources/
